<title>GERMANY: German Jan plant, equipment orders up 16 pct.</title>
<headline>German Jan plant, equipment orders up 16 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>German plant construction and equipment orders rose by 16 percent in real terms in January from the same 1996 month, the engineering industry association VDMA said on Friday.</p>
<p>In the January through November period orders were up one percent from the same year-earlier period. The VDMA statement gave the following data</p>
<p>    January	change in pct  Jan-Nov	     change in pct</p>
<p>    overall	    +16	  overall		+1</p>
<p>    of which German  +28	  of which German    +8</p>
<p>		 foreign +4	   foreign		-5</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
